        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 425FL, Ornate Cathedral Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you have ever seen the Gothic Cathedrals of Europe reaching towards the heavens, then you have seen the epitome of ornate architecture. Omnia's Cathedral Door Lever mimics the attention to fine detail found on those magnificent structures. Choose from Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan Bronze, or Venetian Nickel finishes--all of which have been designed to highlight the intricate details of this 425FL Classico Collection Lever made by Omnia. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\" thick doors with either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-ornate-deadbolt-omnia-flordb\">Matching Single Cylinder Deadbolt</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Imperial Egret Door Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 425FL Classico Collection Cathedral Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>55 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationary door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nThe <b>Single Dummy Lever Functions are Handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other Lever functions are Non-Handed.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-DIVA-Specifications.gif?v=1704354622\" width=\"557\" height=\"103\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Classico Collection Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Cathedral Door Lever",
                "description": "Omnia 425FL, Cathedral Door Lever - If you have ever seen the Gothic Cathedrals of Europe reaching towards the heavens, then you have seen the epitome of ornate architecture. Omnia's Cathedral Door Lever mimics the attention to fine detail found on those magnificent structures but it does so in a tasteful way. Choose from Florentine Brass, Siena Brass, Etruscan Bronze, or Venetian Nickel finishes--all of which have been designed to highlight the intricate details of this 425FL Classico Collection Lever made by Omnia. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions for 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
                "keywords": "Omnia 425FL Classico Collection Cathedral Levers, Cathedral Door Levers, Omnia 425FL, OMN-425FL, ornate levers, ornate leversets, ornate door levers, Omnia Classico Collection, passage levers, privacy levers, Ornate Cathedral Leversets,"
